1
00:00:00,981 --> 00:00:04,401
No. I have never said
that you are not good at what you do.

2
00:00:04,901 --> 00:00:08,701
(Sheldon:)It's just that what you do
is not worth doing.

3
00:00:14,119 --> 00:00:17,539
(Leonard:)It's nicer than anything
he's ever said to me. L'd take it and run.

4
00:00:19,374 --> 00:00:21,044
(Howard:)Thank you, Sheldon.

5
00:00:21,209 --> 00:00:22,879
(Sheldon:)Will you give my paper to Hawking?

6
00:00:23,044 --> 00:00:25,384
(Bernadette:)- Sorry, I can't.
- What? Why not?

7
00:00:25,547 --> 00:00:27,587
l gave it to him three days ago.

8
00:00:28,091 --> 00:00:29,971
(Howard:)He was really impressed.

9
00:00:30,135 --> 00:00:31,265
(Howard:)He wants to meet you.

10
00:00:33,263 --> 00:00:35,263
(Sheldon:)All right, then.

11
00:00:36,391 --> 00:00:37,811
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Howard.

12
00:00:38,601 --> 00:00:40,441
(Sheldon:)Please let Professor Hawking know...

13
00:00:40,603 --> 00:00:43,563
(Sheldon:)...that I'm available
at his earliest convenience.

14
00:00:45,316 --> 00:00:47,906
- Thought he might be more excited.
- Give it a second.

15
00:00:57,370 --> 00:01:05,020
Professor Hawking, it's an honor
and a privilege to meet you, sir.

